 new spirit world. Become the savior of the spirit worlds!", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/raanaa-the-shaman-girl", "videos": [{"id": 131141, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "G_uqMH8JrAU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G_uqMH8JrAU", "title": "Raanaa - The Shaman Girl. Episode 1.", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G_uqMH8JrAU/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}